      "ConcreteType": "Dynamo.Graph.Nodes.CodeBlockNodeModel, DynamoCore",
      "Replication": "Disabled",
      "Description": "Allows for DesignScript code to be authored directly",
      "Code": "De = deRaw * fattore;\nsommaD2 = Math.Sum(Math.Pow(diam, 2) * q);\nAtubo = Math.PI / 4 * Math.Pow(De, 2);\nAcavi = Math.PI / 4 * sommaD2;\nK = Acavi / Atubo;\nDt = Math.Sqrt(sommaD2);"
    },
